      "problem": "The series named ap contains f10.7 solar flux rather than the requested ap index because the code uses zero-based column 50 instead of 49.",
      "about": "requirement",
      "evidence_in_work": "ap=om[50].replace(999,np.nan)",
      "source": "50 I4 999 ap-index nT; 51 F6.1 999.9 f10.7_index",
